   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="berkeley:recid:85285-67.recto_ii.jpg/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP0072_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ẔNH BYRḤ sp̄ndrmṭ QDM ŠNṬ X-III-III
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>MN gcyṭk' ml dšnkrṭ zʾhl
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>MN dlyk' ʿL lnzyṭ BBʾ ḥndlcpṭ'
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>(○) YḤYṬYWNṭn MN (ẔK) zmʾn Y BBʾ ḥndlcpṭ'
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0072_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>ēn māh Spandarmad abar sāl 16
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>az gazīdag mar dašngird zahr
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>az darīg ō ranǰīd dar-handarzbed
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>(○) āwurdan az (ān) zamān ī dar-handarzbed
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0072_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>This month Spandarmad (12th month) of the year 16 (667/8 CE).
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>On account of having been bitten (or stung) an appropriate antidote
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>by an estate assistant to the chamberlain being troubled (since).
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>To be brought in time (lit. from that time of the chamberlain).
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>